'''Puddle Jumper''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Puddle Jumper''' can be fished up anywhere on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} once the player is {{skill|fishing|10}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Puddle Jumper''' is {{Green|100}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|1%|1|100|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

