== Behavior ==
When caught, a red halo appears around the '''Puddle Jumper'''. It waits for the player to cast their fishing line onto it. After {{Green|5}} seconds, regardless of whether the player has hooked it, the halo turns green and the '''Puddle Jumper''' hops to another location. A new red halo appears first upon landing and shows '''{{Rmt|&e&lCOME AND GET ME!}}''' on its head, acting as a timer before the next jump.

If the player successfully hooks the '''Puddle Jumper''', they will be pulled along as it jumps. The '''Puddle Jumper''' will hop a total of {{Green|5}} times before stopping and shows '''{{Rmt|&a&lRIBBIT}}''' above every time they jump. It drops its loot {{Green|13}} seconds after the final halo appears.

Additionally, if the player does not miss a single hook throughout the encounter, they are awarded with an extra {{Item|Silver Lotus}}.

