== Notes ==
* It's not necessary for any player to hook the '''Puddle Jumper''', as it can finish its journey on its own.
* The player who fishes up a '''Puddle Jumper''' always gets its loot, even without jumping with it.

== Tips ==
*Donating the [[Trophy Frogs#Puddle Jumper|Puddle Jumper Trophy Frog]] to {{NPCSprite|Researcher Ribery}} grants significantly more {{Item|Lotus}} than either its base drop or the bonus {{Item|Silver Lotus}} for jumping with it {{Green|5}} times.
**The only case this is false is if the player drops a {{Item|Gold Lotus}}.

== Trivia ==
* Despite not being a [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]], the {{Item|Grappling Hook}} can be used to hook the '''Puddle Jumper'''.
* '''Puddle Jumper''' doesn't get affected by {{Ench|Expertise}} {{Skill|Fishing}} XP boost.
* During the first and second testing sessions on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], fishing up a '''Puddle Jumper''' on {{Gamemode|Stranded}} would crash the lobby.
** The ability to fish up '''Puddle Jumpers''' (as well as all other [[Lotus Atoll]] Sea Creatures) on {{Gamemode|Stranded}} was later disabled, presumably at least in part due to this bug.

